    "This is the explicit read-only primary-data inspection prerequisite; no repair command, automatic startup scan, replacement fetch, index rebuild, quarantine or repair publication is implemented.",
    "Tests use isolated finite local fixtures and no live peers/production data/remote host. Original startup remains intentionally lightweight; draft before/after controls are development regressions, not original-repository findings.",
